== Decision
- *Decision:* #s("revise"). *Claim tier:* an instrument infrastructure stop; no mathematics. *Evidence strength:* none assigned (nothing was measured about the instrument's correctness).
- *Scope (decision\_scope, condensed):* (1) composes the 96fee7 outcome as an infrastructure stop; (2) DEV-1 runs again, unchanged, on the bound bytes (code\_sha256 5d5a607d...1464) under a detached supervisor with heartbeat, exit record, restart detection, re-attach and a bounded retry rule (TASK-20261107-bc7a76), dispatch withheld until the owner answers OQ-1 and a committed act releases it; (3) the hardening re-review TASK-20261107-7db1de runs first, alone, never in parallel with DEV-1, and B8 is split into B8-H and B8-D; (4) checkpoints BATCH-a8825c and opens BATCH-c077fd. #s("predictions_to_freeze") of DEC-20261105-f0b7c7 and V2-1 to V2-6 are unchanged.
- *Supersedes, in part and never in content:* DEC-20261106-475620 #s("dev1_decision_v2.placement") clause (d) only, and its B8 verdict and clears\_when (split, decisive evidence unchanged); TASK-20261106-941825 and TASK-20261106-afbe9b, never dispatched, cancelled and replaced by 7db1de and 971edf.
- *Records:* DEC-20261106-24d2a2, DEC-20261106-475620, TASK-20261106-96fee7 (c1ba901dfd), TASK-20261106-dfd0ed (5f6c092450), TASK-20261106-2b7223, TASK-20261107-0932f4, -58546f, -7db1de, -971edf, -bc7a76, -eebc5b, EXP-MONO-1a1be2, H-MONO-23d347, BATCH-a8825c, BATCH-c077fd.

